[152.281205, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Timeline and Working Checklist\n\n## Timeline of Key Events and Investigation\n- **2026-08-11 01:00 UTC - 03:20 UTC**: EDR alerts triggered by high CPU usage and process execution (`/sas/alerts.json:2`). Incident ticket opened (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1`).\n- **Initial Entry & Exploitation**: External actor accessed unauthenticated Redis service exposed on 0.0.0.0 (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`). Shell commands executed via Redis `CONFIG SET` / module loading (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:1`).\n- **Persistence Dropped**: Malicious cron job written to root crontab to beacon to attacker IP and re-download payload (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`).\n- **Stealth / Rootkit Installed**: Attacker configured userland dynamic linker hijack via `/etc/ld.so.preload` referencing `/lib/.hide.so` (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`).\n- **Impact Execution**: Cryptominer `kdevtmpfsi` executed under `/tmp/.redis/` connecting to external pool (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:1`).\n- **Forensic Analysis Phase**: DFIR team inspected disk image (`/disk`), SAS alert feeds (`/sas/alerts.json:1`), baseline checks (`/sas/baseline.json:1`), and CTI advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1`).\n- **Reconciliation Phase**: Draft change ticket `CHG-5677` reconciled in-place (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`) and findings formatted (`/sas/handoff/findings.json:1`).\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Mount read-only forensic disk copy (`/disk`) and security product output (`/sas`)\n- [x] Review CTI threat intelligence advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1`)\n- [x] Analyze endpoint alerts (`/sas/alerts.json:1`) and baseline checks (`/sas/baseline.json:1`)\n- [x] Identify initial access vector (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`)\n- [x] Identify cryptominer artifact (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:1`)\n- [x] Identify cron persistence mechanism (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:5`)\n- [x] Identify unalerted silent persistence / stealth hooks (`/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`)\n- [x] Identify unalerted staged payload modules (`/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:1`)\n- [x] Identify wiped binary evidence / C2 beacon records (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n- [x] Reconcile stale/incorrect draft change ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`)\n- [x] Generate valid findings JSON (`/sas/handoff/findings.json:1`)\n- [x] Complete required deliverables in `/app` (`progress.md`, `intrusion-report.md`, `vuln-report.md`, `baseline-report.md`, `remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
